{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0376cb9dc1e4e5382f9316a143c5abb01fdd241ae52f39f4aae24c0426d57661","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_36d9524ce2809e4624d930f1b9e8ed621f5309da9cfd3c8872950320553ee042","slc_b50604a049c5741ea17d9df563a370f165db1745eedd151aeae27b289e93b33a","slc_c5f6600884721f4f4e60bbfb93cdd507cff528e321d479431e7325141b51ff81","slc_e5546f8b84e4e8054b53e82b3ef39c574b54b89032a23557c6303e733a6fdf88"],"source_ids":["src_5254ed58687b593e9bbd66c99f4a2a50","src_f6eb8d6767735207bb507b7ed060384d"],"text":"An autonomy dial (autonomous, balanced, collaborative) controls how often undiscussed decisions surface to the user; irreversible operations always ask regardless of the setting.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0cbd08a771b8296897647ddfd461fc3e6888d57b48c7d99de9159ad2aadd9598","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_32b9cf194631355d749588daa6d86e5002398b6427021a1bd01d555f4e6c4945","slc_389014842bb46d9cf834934246f564e4c7be5113046cbd58ef12d5420010e1e0","slc_6659d19f16c94074bc2604c94095d7e9292fa243b6a68642190f892c123138b2"],"source_ids":["src_5254ed58687b593e9bbd66c99f4a2a50","src_f6eb8d6767735207bb507b7ed060384d"],"text":"Two isolated, read-only supervisors review each action: an Architect (default Opus) catching spec drift and undiscussed decisions, and a Code Reviewer (default Sonnet) catching real defects.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2b5fca4fbdb8f61b809b951035372c2ae3c4e8d8a38433bd8551ab5727e836ea","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2c5aaa06bc46dc6c7fa01e24c543d49c1da678b247962e0961069fbee83a39ef","slc_357d286050a34fb5f9fc38d67d81a29cb051ec5f5f425319a1124e0664b37dc1","slc_c75ded6cf768a97691ce52dd1e2f83e17b0880d0940a395ae4ac9dfe41a611e5"],"source_ids":["src_f6eb8d6767735207bb507b7ed060384d"],"text":"CLI commands include gadfly init (requires spec.md), status, config, disable/enable, and uninstall; configuration lives in gadfly.toml with optional keys and defaults.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6e22ef057fda910ee0e87b17b2ee20fd68a37cf0429878214ecf9f8f4a44e473","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_38ca4d84db1c200178a60ad44c716edbd7ff6bb8b096fbc23fd94315f5583d7b","slc_c4593cd27c90ea5a06a6eabf8334462317002f1bc9aacc68afa7c1241495de04"],"source_ids":["src_5254ed58687b593e9bbd66c99f4a2a50","src_f6eb8d6767735207bb507b7ed060384d"],"text":"A deterministic first pass auto-allows reads and safe commands without any model call, so LLM supervisors only engage for consequential actions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_882b5a009d20356626caeca0fce2ef4dea0809cb8f0957a34a4b5c2818a6f74e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4cfbbe256c57e3f9dabb9d3fd485dc16e1cc82a76a0c11dcdc90a66ac20a362a","slc_bce54f87ffd9e0e4d286a2a82944190fa309f21e0426f87c1a28ec05d0a9428e"],"source_ids":["src_f6eb8d6767735207bb507b7ed060384d"],"text":"Gadfly is a Socratic supervision layer that sits inside an AI coding agent's live tool-call loop, questioning consequential moves before they happen.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9fa9a915c32de59faea3bc7abde5774307efafd0cc54a1f1b389fa2352fc5bb5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_017fe49bf3a0e817df150944ab4502adc199112ec718aba1f67867cabeda1833","slc_25482f682a6ebc6b971bfb4adf3b75e34ce8e90d734b890bca35e8003224ca25"],"source_ids":["src_5254ed58687b593e9bbd66c99f4a2a50"],"text":"Stated v1 non-goals include no post-hoc QA practitioner, no taskmaster, no full interactive or training mode, no daemon, and no adapters for other agents; supervisors never write code or run commands.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ab7e1510af2897fcc01b0870d5de99ed98701b21ec245f46ff92e20ea52ea3e9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2147448dfe6e6fc094171524e29556212f3cacca0e3aa6fd2670f8985e7c70df","slc_c4593cd27c90ea5a06a6eabf8334462317002f1bc9aacc68afa7c1241495de04"],"source_ids":["src_5254ed58687b593e9bbd66c99f4a2a50","src_f6eb8d6767735207bb507b7ed060384d"],"text":"The agent can read the memory files but is denied direct writes to spec.md, claude.md, and decisions.md; those files change only via the human or Gadfly.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b4ccc116b835aebcec2404e3f20b46b41253febeaa4e61885b1a909b70420d37","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_43e55d2f62613fb0f6317bfecdd6def2c12a44605f9c905b1ad2a7e49eb87667","slc_dde5348d0f8567107c8b5c64bfb10e68d57dc6e4b615de5ad9b02dbab14a251f"],"source_ids":["src_f6eb8d6767735207bb507b7ed060384d"],"text":"Reviews produce four verdicts: silent allow, a question sent back to the agent, a surface that pauses and asks the user, and a block on spec-violating or buggy actions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bf256486053b36ff38b0f85aa8e9d829fe29d2a531e09a20927bda49a84ed054","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_44d6f512e194794ed8eac0db03a202fb5445c2c753efbc79b87385c1f2efbed0","slc_6f5b6708f3898d7e646681dd11f71a175810a831e7cb1231ebfc2af921d49a46","slc_97b6c0649fbbf3585df91866872dc02d3103b185dcb9246ec61502869165e0f2"],"source_ids":["src_5254ed58687b593e9bbd66c99f4a2a50","src_f6eb8d6767735207bb507b7ed060384d"],"text":"Supervision is grounded in five project files: spec.md (human, required), claude.md (human, optional), codemap.md (builder), decisions.md and memory.md (Gadfly-owned), with a defined trust order.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d2b7cb21345ad8a16acaf4d91a6e01487d384ea065d42a579f3337e120f6fb30","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_32cedc6d333ec4bd3fd021379a50ae4bf09a0199f1cc6cc7c2ad9114affc728c","slc_5e22f7e59edae2d089c25403b8f15d4d9ea1a30f779774ebfcf102a8aeaa023c","slc_851f12f2a384faaadb1e65a007ae11d3d78e87555d9a1f2a3eebe74ab5417d93"],"source_ids":["src_5254ed58687b593e9bbd66c99f4a2a50","src_f6eb8d6767735207bb507b7ed060384d"],"text":"Architecture is a pure, agent- and LLM-agnostic core wrapped by two swappable adapters (host-agent format and LLM provider); supervisors call a provider-neutral client with models set in config.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","created_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d62a014318873671a1dfa88b3cdb168357da3e9f8df32c2eb7e4ff12429dbd5e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"touchpoint-labs/gadfly@2798406b5d27 snapshot 8e44562db5006424","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_26539f87adf66ba3af51a671b2c9816f41f2934254c4b70ef8981f51ad30761e","slc_40ec1c22856d8df8f5823ae2f6fc09033b050acb4acee0af4744344a71cc339e","slc_bba7ae3e67e7221580f47ea1115dcfca334a162e669b7d0ee6fc374d32b302fb","slc_c440ad37ae688b7c69928548f9a5630f39d1752927d15d25c67615e585977041"],"source_ids":["src_f6eb8d6767735207bb507b7ed060384d"],"text":"The project advertises zero dependencies, targets Python 3.11+, is MIT licensed, and in v1 supervises only Claude Code, running on the user's existing subscription without an API key.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:27:36Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bea5639e73094f5c9c9a1b560b66ecba"}
